Package: Rducksassy
Type: Package
Title: Approximate Text and Sequence Search in DuckDB
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure", email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Rick", "Beeloo", role = "cph",
           comment = "Sassy library"),
    person("Ragnar", "Groot Koerkamp", role = "cph",
           comment = "Sassy library"),
    person("Stichting DuckDB Foundation", role = "cph",
           comment = "Bundled C API headers and extension metadata tool"))
Description: Builds and loads the 'ducksassy' DuckDB extension for approximate
    text, DNA and CRISPR searches using the 'Sassy' Rust library by Beeloo and
    Groot Koerkamp (2026) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btag244>. Search results
    compose with SQL filtering, joins and aggregation. FASTA and FASTQ readers
    are supplied by 'Rduckhts'. Loading the extension requires a DuckDB host
    with C API v2 support.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Copyright: See inst/LICENCE.note for bundled dependency authors and licenses.
URL: https://github.com/RGenomicsETL/ducksassy
BugReports: https://github.com/RGenomicsETL/ducksassy/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: DBI, duckdb, Rduckhts (>= 1.5.2)
Suggests: duckdb.2.0.dev
Additional_repositories: https://duckdb.r-universe.dev,
    https://rgenomicsetl.r-universe.dev
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc (>= 1.91), CMake (>= 3.20), Python (>= 3),
    C11 compiler with POSIX threads
OS_type: unix
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
